+For the finite flat double cover, trace splitting gives
+`pi_*O_E = O_C direct-sum M`.  Its discriminant is the quartic
+`delta_C in H^0(C,O_C(4))`, so `M^{-2}=O_C(4)`.  Since `C ~= P1`,
+`M=O_C(-2)`, and therefore
