+The canonical formula has the right sign and coefficient.  Since the center is
+a codimension-two smooth complete intersection in the smooth threefold,
+
+```text
+K_Bl = rho^*K_W + E_W,
+Xnu = rho^*X - 2E_W,
+```
+
+and adjunction gives
+
+```text
+K_Xnu = nu^*K_X - E,
+K_Xnu + E = nu^*K_X.
+```
